   "id": "story_twibbles",
   "start": 70999,
   "lines": [
    "You finally collect enough",
    "of the hard to get crystals",
    "to invest in the medicinal",
    "         slug farm.",
    "You head towards the local",
    " Galactic Trading Post...",
    "       Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "story_twibbles2",
   "start": 71505,
   "lines": [
    "            Later...",
    " At first, Mylo thought he had",
    "finally discovered the get rich",
    "scheme he@d been searching for",
    "         all his life.",
    "His plan was to sell the giant,",
    "full body slugs to the Galactic",
    "  Medical Conglomeration for",
    "       medical purposes.",
    "        Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "story_finale",
   "start": 73041,
   "lines": [
    "After yet another failure, Mylo",
    "is more determined than ever to",
    "        strike it rich.",
    "In the final episode, you@ll go",
    " back to the crystal caves to",
    "get enough crystals for Mylo@s",
    "   most ambitious scheme yet.",
    "Can he pass the deadly aliens,",
    "traps and puzzles once again?",
    "   Only one way to find out!",
    "  Play Mylo@s adventure today!",
    "        Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
